WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,526
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,476 --> 00:00:05,952
Lulu has a shiny badge, but the blue door stays shut!

3
00:00:05,952 --> 00:00:09,821
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:09,821 --> 00:00:12,357
This is Episode 41.

5
00:00:12,357 --> 00:00:14,500
Maya looks closer.

6
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,905
Every door has a list.

7
00:00:16,905 --> 00:00:18,869
Green means may.

8
00:00:18,869 --> 00:00:20,988
Red means may not.

9
00:00:20,988 --> 00:00:23,595
The blue door says may not.

10
00:00:23,595 --> 00:00:25,917
The badge does not matter.

11
00:00:25,917 --> 00:00:28,667
Lulu zips to the yellow door.

12
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:29,988
Green!

13
00:00:29,988 --> 00:00:31,976
It swings open.

14
00:00:31,976 --> 00:00:35,869
The green door has a green line and a red line.

15
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:37,738
Which one wins?

16
00:00:37,738 --> 00:00:38,952
Red.

17
00:00:38,952 --> 00:00:41,321
May-not always wins.

18
00:00:41,321 --> 00:00:43,381
Right doors open.

19
00:00:43,381 --> 00:00:45,690
Wrong doors stay shut.

20
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:53,786
That is an IAM policy: a list on each door that says who may do what, and one "may not" always wins.

21
00:00:53,786 --> 00:00:57,988
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
